#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-9443 expect=skipped domain=TP
#note "CDISC-SEND-9443 (minted by PLAN-rprfdy-offset-tp-join, D-MINT; sheet issue #277): within one repro phase (RPHASE) of one repro path (RPATHCD), TP's stages carry ONE first phase day reference — has_multiple_values_for(RPRFDY, RPATHCD, within=[RPHASE]) flags every populated stage row of a (path, phase) that maps to two or more RPRFDY values. TP without RPRFDY — Requirements.Variables.All [RPATHCD, RPHASE, RPRFDY] is unmet, so the rule SKIPS."
#library standard=sendig-dart version=1-2
dataset TP class="TRIAL DESIGN" label="Trial Repro Paths"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col RPATHCD  type=Char label="Planned Repro Path Code"
col TPSTGORD type=Num  label="Order of Repro Stage within Repro Path"
col RSTGCD   type=Char label="Repro Stage Code"
col RSTAGE   type=Char label="Description of Repro Stage"
col RPHASE   type=Char label="Repro Phase"
---
S1 | TP | A | 1 | STG1 | Stg1 | P1
S1 | TP | A | 2 | STG2 | Stg2 | P1
---
